            ["Complement activation","Complement proteins in the plasma lyse the pathogen&rsquo;s plasma membrane once antibodies have bound and identified it"],
            ["Toxin neutralization","Antibodies bind to toxins in the plasma, preventing them from affecting susceptible cells"],
            ["Opsonization","Antibodies bind to pathogens, making them instantly recognizable and linking them to phagocytic cells"]
